  "root_problem": "Dispute ticket volume roughly doubled from a ~600/month baseline (Jun/Jul 2026) to 1180-1260/month (Aug/Sep 2026) (E-07), caused by billing import validation rule BV-17 (deployed 2026-08-01, E-12), which compares raw AMI register values to 12-month m3 consumption history with unit_scaling \"none\"; this misreads firmware-v4.2 meters' 0.1-m3-unit readings (rolled out 2026-06, E-13) as roughly 10x true consumption, causing 1184 legitimate high-consumption actual reads to be falsely rejected (REJECTED_HIGH_CONSUMPTION) and fall back to estimated billing (E-11), producing incorrect bills that drive the dispute surge."
 },
